WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.425
This is a decision briefing for a CIO,
a budget officer and an endpoint lead.

2
00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:08.427
An agency weighing a
refresh is being asked to

3
00:00:08.427 --> 00:00:11.587
fund a distribution point
at every field office.

4
00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:15.221
The question is whether that is
the right way to deliver content,

5
00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:18.375
or whether fewer servers and
a better network do the job.

6
00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:22.448
The numbers come from the worked case
in the Network and Transport book,

7
00:00:22.448 --> 00:00:26.175
a framing pattern with every cost
labeled as a planning estimate.

8
00:00:26.175 --> 00:00:30.025
We'll cover the decision, the
questions to answer first,

9
00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:32.300
the options, the plan, and the ask.
